@baseurl= https://elevate-horizon-connect-api.onrender.com

### health check ###
GET {{baseurl}}/api/health

### get all events ###

GET {{baseurl}}/api/events

### get single event ###

GET {{baseurl}}/api/events/18

### get date ###

GET {{baseurl}}/api/events/today?date=2026-11-20

### get music category ###

GET {{baseurl}}/api/events?=category=Music


##### register for an event ###

POST {{baseurl}}/api/registrations
Contnt-Type: application/json
x-api-key: student_secret_render_888

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "test.person@example.com"
}

